<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (GNCE Mercury \(FTC Team 26413\) is a student-led high school robotics team based in Weston, Massachusetts. Founded in 2024, our team consists of 10 student members supported by 4 volunteer coaches. Each competition season, our students design, prototype, fabricate, code, and test a fully functional competitive robot. Beyond competition, our team leads community STEM outreach: we mentor local Weston FIRST LEGO League teams, host annual STEM summer camps, and provide remote technical mentorship to an emerging robotics team in South Africa.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
